NTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98862","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98862","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98862.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98862.patch","merged_at":"2024-11-26T19:13:42Z"},"body":"This PR registers the `Engine`, `ProjectSettings`, `OS`, and `Time` singletons to ClassDB earlier so that GDExtensions can access them during `INITIALIZATION_LEVEL_CORE`. Previously, these were only accessible in `INITIALIZATION_LEVEL_SCENE` and later.\r\n\r\nAddresses [GIP#9134](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9134).\r\n\r\nThis is done by:\r\n- Using `GDREGISTER_CLASS` and calling `Engine::add_singleton` for the 4 singletons before `register_core_extensions()`.\r\n- Setting Engine and OS values earlier _when possible_ (e.g., `Engine::set_project_manager_hint`.\r\n- Adding a null check for `TextServerManager::get_singleton` in `OS_Windows::get_system_font_path_for_text` to prevent a crash since Windows needs the `TextServerManager` to get the text direction, which is not created until after `INITIALIZATION_LEVEL_CORE`.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Caveats:**\r\nWhile the exposed singleton methods are all safe to call, they may not return the expected value if they depend on later setup. These exceptions include:\r\n- The order of `GLOBAL_DEF`, etc. calls for project settings unrelated to the 4 singletons is mostly untouched, meaning many defaults are not set until after `INITIALIZATION_LEVEL_CORE` (e.g., `rendering/*` settings from `RenderingServer::init()`).\r\n- `OS::has_feature` will still return false for any server feature until `RenderingServer` has been created.\r\n- `OS_Windows::get_system_font_path_for_text` depends on the `TextServer` and will return the empty string until it is created.\r\n\r\n**Notes on dependencies and code-paths of exposed singleton methods:** [[Google Sheets Link]](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19gnuqFmEcC65Krp6WUHAgspfWd7XaG3G)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98862/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98862/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}